OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's Labour group leader
OL,4,Ajoins Conservatives
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Labour group on East
OL,7,FRiding of Yorkshire Council has
OL,8,Fdefected to the Conservatives.
OL,10,FSteve Gallant, currently a councillor
OL,11,Fin the South West Holderness ward, said
OL,12,Fhis decision followed a meeting where
OL,13,Fhe claimed he was told by the regional
OL,14,FLabour Party he would not be standing
OL,15,Fas their candidate in the local
OL,16,Felections next May.
OL,18,F"I thought it made sense for me to
OL,19,Fcontinue to represent the people in my
OL,20,Farea and I'll do that in a party that
OL,21,Fwelcomes me as opposed to one that
OL,22,Fwants to block me," he said.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
