OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's Labour group leader
OL,4,Ajoins Conservatives
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour Party said it did not
OL,7,Fcomment on individual cases, but the
OL,8,FBBC understands it will not put forward
OL,9,FGallant as a candidate in May's
OL,10,Felections.
